+# Frontend environment — everything is OPTIONAL.
+# Out of the box the app needs no env vars: all data is static under public/data/.
+
+# Optional: serve the large, git-excluded PMTiles tile archives from an external
+# static host/CDN instead of same-origin. Must be set at BUILD time.
+# Leave unset for GitHub-import deploys (the UI degrades honestly without tiles).
+# NEXT_PUBLIC_TILES_BASE=https://tiles.example.com
